                    <h3 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-3" style="font-weight: 800 !important; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: -0.3px; color: #061B56 !important;">Pourquoi choisir<br>TrouveMoi Prestataires ?</h3>
                    
                    <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-3 mb-4">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-2">
